AltoMintMarket::accrueInterest()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
└── when market is not paused
    ├── when irm is zero address
    │   └── it should do nothing
    └── when irm is not zero address
        ├── when interest is zero
        │   └── it should do nothing and not emit any event
        └── when interest is non-zero
            ├── it should update claimableFeesAssets and totalBorrowed.assets
            ├── it should not update totalSupply.assets
            └── it should emit AccrueInterest event
